(:include "reach.domain")

// Shared tier: eat or drink. Hunger before thirst; the item is the host's best candidate; walk up to it and consume.
//
// Teaches: the tier's real precondition as one axiom (`feed_target`) that the root uses as its guard and that also
// picks the target, so the root branch states why the tier applies; utility selection moved into a host sensor that
// publishes candidates best-first (first match = best).
// Source: Space Station 14 (MIT), `FoodCompound` in Resources/Prototypes/NPCs/nutrition.yml and the `NearbyFood` /
// `NearbyDrink` utility queries in utility_queries.yml, at commit 614f030530578e248a2393dd71ee9813d68d800d:
// https://github.com/space-wizards/space-station-14/blob/614f030530578e248a2393dd71ee9813d68d800d/Resources/Prototypes/NPCs/nutrition.yml
// Licence: MIT, Copyright (c) 2017-2026 Space Wizards Federation; see src/examples/canon/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
// Adapted (YAML prototypes re-written in our domain language).
// Emulations:
// - SS14 `UtilityOperator proto: NearbyFood` scores candidates while planning (distance, food value, accessible)
//   and writes the best into `Target`; here the host sensor publishes `(food ?item)` / `(drink ?item)` rows sorted
//   best-first and the first row that matches wins.
// - SS14's two branches (hunger, thirst) have the threshold test on their first primitive; ours are the two arms
//   of the `feed_target` axiom, in the same order, and the shared "go and consume" is one task.
// Deviations: satiation is a number per need, 0 (starving) to 100 (full), below a threshold = wants it (SS14 uses
// named thresholds, `Peckish` and `Parched`). The final `WaitOperator IdleTime` of each SS14 branch is not ported:
// it only waits when an idle wait was already rolled, and the idle tier covers that.
// Not ported: the `TargetIsAliveCon` / `FoodValueCon` scoring itself (the host's sensor), `AltInteractOperator`'s
// interaction verbs (one `!consume`).
//
// Facts:      (satiation hunger|thirst ?level) 0-100; (food ?item), (drink ?item) host sensors, best first;
//             (distance_to ?entity ?metres).
// Primitives: (!move_near ?entity ?range) (!consume ?item)

(:domain feed

    (:constants FeedTier
        (peckish 50)
        (parched 50)
    )

    (:axiom (hungry)
        (and
            (satiation hunger ?level)
            (< ?level @peckish)
        )
    )

    (:axiom (thirsty)
        (and
            (satiation thirst ?level)
            (< ?level @parched)
        )
    )

    // What to eat or drink now: the best food when hungry, else the best drink when thirsty.
    (:axiom (feed_target ?out_item)
        (or
            (and
                (#hungry)
                (food ?out_item)
            )
            (and
                (#thirsty)
                (drink ?out_item)
            )
        )
    )

    // Contract: ?inp_item is consumed; never fails.
    (:method (feed ?inp_item)

        (go_and_consume
            ()
            (
                (get_in_range ?inp_item @melee_range)
                (!consume ?inp_item)
            )
        )
    )
)
